        "created_at": "2017-11-02T13:11:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ameena\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/48/1907_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ameena:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Just backed it - looks pretty fun :).</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>The physical version is a fun little game! Lots of interesting decisions to make!&nbsp; <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grin.png?v=12\" title=\":grin:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grin:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
