        "id": 206241,
        "name": "darkroydante",
        "username": "darkroydante",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/darkroydante/{size}/2044_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-02T20:50:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The game is absolutely a blast to play. It very much has a rogue-like feel. It's accessible, but a more experienced player will know what to look for in terms of skills that combo well together, and can create some really amazing builds. And then you still get brutally murdered when you roll 1's against a Phantom.&nbsp;</p><p>I can't wait to see John and Jeremy playing this on Stream. Also looking forward to the dev streams!&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
