        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-11-03T10:47:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I figure it's the card equivalent of a Roguelike computer game - never played the original Rogue (don't even know what it looks like), but I've spent many hours in a game called Caveblazers which is pretty fun and which I know is along those lines (similar to another game called Spelunky). Out of curiosity I just Googled for the physical game and it's out of stock at Games Lore and over a hundred quid(!?) on Amazon :O. So I'm guessing it's been around long enough to go out of print or something, because wow.</p>",
