        "created_at": "2017-11-04T09:59:56.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hmm, looking at that link it appears I can still pre-order the game and/or expansion from there,a nd a little further digging on the Kickstarter's main page has turned up the shipping costs. A quick check of the Google currency converter shows that it would cost me over 40 quid for both the base game and expansion, plus shpping. Hm. Maybe I'll think about it - I'm not sure who I'd get to play it with, anyway.</p>",
